WEBVTT

00:03:28.704 --> 00:03:33.334
I've often referred, half jokingly,
to this long period of human history

00:03:33.376 --> 00:03:37.004
as the era of the first global village.

00:03:37.421 --> 00:03:41.592
Because it's not just the technological
innovations that are so remarkable,

00:03:41.634 --> 00:03:43.469
but also the social innovations

00:03:43.511 --> 00:03:46.514
which enabled people
to do all these things

00:03:46.555 --> 00:03:48.641
without forming centers

00:03:48.641 --> 00:03:54.438
and without raising up a class
of permanent leaders over everybody else.

00:03:55.356 --> 00:03:56.983
Now, oddly enough,

00:03:57.024 --> 00:04:02.738
this efflorescence of culture
is not what we usually refer to